      "interpretation": "Under full C/F/nabla/D/H, indexClass and characteristicFormula are genuinely dependent supplied records. traceFormula? and ghostObstruction? can be absent. indexFormulaCertified is an independent arbitrary Prop with its proof; no equation connects trace/obstruction slots or proves an index formula."
